        "Content": "Killincarrig, Greystones, Co. Wicklow\r\n\r\nStylish three-bedroom end-of-terrace home with exceptional south-facing garden\r\n\r\nGuide Price: €725,000\r\n\r\nProperty Description\r\n\r\nTurley Property Advisors are delighted to present 9 Adare Close, an exceptionally well-presented three-bedroom end-of-terrace home occupying a particularly attractive position within this exclusive development in the heart of Killincarrig Village.\r\n\r\nAdare Close is an intimate and secluded development of just five architect-designed homes, offering a rare combination of privacy, modern specification and convenient access to everything Greystones has to offer.\r\n\r\nNo. 9 is presented in immaculate, turnkey condition throughout and has been thoughtfully designed to maximise natural light and comfortable family living. The accommodation is arranged over two levels and extends to approximately 103 sq. m. (1,108 sq. ft.), providing a particularly efficient and versatile layout.\r\n\r\nAt ground-floor level, the heart of the house is the spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area. This is a bright, contemporary space ideally suited to both everyday family life and entertaining, with direct access to the outdoor areas. A separate room to the front provides additional flexibility and is suitable as a third bedroom, home office, family room or guest accommodation. An additional playroom/ office, a guest WC and useful storage complete the ground-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nUpstairs are two generous double bedrooms, including a main bedroom with ensuite, together with a stylish family bathroom and additional storage.\r\n\r\nOne of the property's standout features is its superb south-facing garden positioned to the side of the house. Benefiting from excellent sunlight throughout the day, this is a genuine sun trap and provides an unusually attractive outdoor entertaining space. It is perfectly suited to summer dining, barbecues, family gatherings and larger social occasions, and significantly enhances the overall appeal of the property.\r\n\r\nAs an end-of-terrace home, No. 9 enjoys a greater sense of openness and privacy than many comparable properties, while also benefiting from two designated parking spaces to the front.\r\n\r\nThe property was constructed to a high modern specification and incorporates air-to-water heating, with underfloor heating at ground-floor level, providing an efficient and comfortable living environment.\r\n\r\nThe combination of immaculate condition, excellent accommodation, private setting and exceptional south-facing outdoor space makes No. 9 a particularly compelling opportunity in the Greystones market.\r\n\r\nLocation\r\n\r\nAdare Close enjoys a wonderfully convenient yet secluded setting in Killincarrig Village, one of Greystones' most established residential locations.\r\n\r\nThe development itself is a quiet private cul-de-sac comprising just five homes, creating an attractive sense of exclusivity while remaining within easy reach of the town centre.\r\n\r\nGreystones Main Street is approximately a 15-minute walk away, placing an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, independent shops and everyday amenities within comfortable reach. Greystones is renowned for its vibrant coastal lifestyle, combining the atmosphere of a thriving town with access to the harbour, marina, seafront and surrounding countryside.\r\n\r\nThe location is particularly appealing for families, with a strong selection of schools, sporting clubs and recreational amenities available throughout Greystones and the surrounding area.\r\n\r\nFor commuters, Greystones benefits from excellent transport connectivity to Dublin and the wider region, while the town's DART and bus services make it an established choice for those seeking a coastal lifestyle without sacrificing accessibility.\r\n\r\nResidents of Adare Close also enjoy the attractive amenity green positioned to the front of the development, further enhancing the quiet residential character of the scheme.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\nExceptional three-bedroom end-of-terrace home\r\nApproximately 103 sq. m. / 1,108 sq. ft.\r\nPresented in immaculate turnkey condition\r\nExclusive development of just five homes\r\nSuperb south-facing side garden\r\nExceptional outdoor entertaining and hosting space\r\nBright open-plan kitchen / dining / living accommodation\r\nMain bedroom with ensuite\r\nFlexible ground-floor bedroom / study / family room\r\nTwo parking spaces to the front\r\nAir-to-water heating\r\nUnderfloor heating at ground-floor level\r\nQuiet and secluded cul-de-sac setting\r\nApproximately 15 minutes' walk from Greystones Main Street\r\nConvenient to the town centre, coast and local amenities\r\n\r\nGuide Price: €725,000"
      },
